<title>USA: Acadiana Bancshares Inc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Acadiana Bancshares Inc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, La. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	     1996</p>
<p> Net interest income			   2,358	    1,658</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses			45		 45</p>
<p> Net income (loss)				 771		283</p>
<p> Income per share				 0.31		N/A</p>
<p>(Dollars in Thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share for the first quarter of 1996 were not comparable because the company converted from a mutual to stock form and reorganized into a holding company format in July 1996.</p>
<p>The company said that in the first quarter of 1997 it repurchased 109,250 shares of common for its Recognition and Retention Plan.</p>
